{
  "version": 1,
  "courseId": 995016,
  "courseSlug": "vuejs-2-the-complete-guide",
  "courseTitle": "Vue - The Complete Guide (incl. Router & Composition API)",
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-TW",
  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "21526356",
      "title": "Deleting Items",
      "lectureOrder": 139,
      "videoOrder": 121,
      "sourceHash": "e0b9ce605da6ddce77837f7276c65d45acbef3b0854deb33d7418d6ca3ac18de",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.1,
          "end": 5.23,
          "en": "So let's make sure Resources can be deleted.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 5.23,
          "end": 7.72,
          "en": "For that we got this Delete button here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 7.72,
          "end": 10.6,
          "en": "in the learning Resource.view file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 10.6,
          "end": 13.408,
          "en": "At the moment this button isn't doing anything though.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 13.408,
          "end": 17.85,
          "en": "Now of course it should remove the Resource",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 17.85,
          "end": 22.04,
          "en": "on which we click this from our storedResources array",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 22.04,
          "end": 23.778,
          "en": "in the Resources.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 23.778,
          "end": 26.74,
          "en": "Now, since we're using dynamic components,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 26.74,
          "end": 30.349,
          "en": "custom events are probably not how we wanna solve this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 30.349,
          "end": 35.04,
          "en": "And therefore, instead I will do it just like we're handling",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 35.04,
          "end": 37.36,
          "en": "it for adding Resources.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 37.36,
          "end": 41.92,
          "en": "I'll add a removeResource method here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 41.92,
          "end": 44.77,
          "en": "where I expect to get that Resource ID",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 44.77,
          "end": 47.59,
          "en": "of the Resource that should be deleted.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 47.59,
          "end": 50.353,
          "en": "And now we need to update our storedResources.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 52.42,
          "end": 54.31,
          "en": "Now, there are two ways of doing that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 54.31,
          "end": 56.24,
          "en": "and I will, first of all show you the way",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 56.24,
          "end": 60.196,
          "en": "that will not work and let you know why it's not working.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 60.196,
          "end": 64.43,
          "en": "The first approach would be that we set our storedResources",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 64.43,
          "end": 67.3,
          "en": "equal to a new array, a new array,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 67.3,
          "end": 69.93,
          "en": "which is the rive from storedResources,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 69.93,
          "end": 73.13,
          "en": "but where we use the filter method to filter out",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 73.13,
          "end": 75.7,
          "en": "the Resource that has this ID.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 75.7,
          "end": 78.73,
          "en": "For that we could execute a function on every Resource.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 78.73,
          "end": 81.106,
          "en": "JavaScript does this for us automatically.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 81.106,
          "end": 84.689,
          "en": "And we will ensure that the Resource",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 84.689,
          "end": 86.61,
          "en": "with the ID we're getting here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 86.61,
          "end": 89.233,
          "en": "gets dropped by adding this code.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 90.871,
          "end": 94.47999999999999,
          "en": "This will indeed if I Console.log this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 94.47999999999999,
          "end": 96.68299999999999,
          "en": "this will indeed ensure that the Resource",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 96.68299999999999,
          "end": 98.40299999999999,
          "en": "is removed from storedResources.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 99.495,
          "end": 102.12,
          "en": "We can now provide this function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 102.12,
          "end": 104.97999999999999,
          "en": "just as we're providing addResource.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 104.97999999999999,
          "end": 107.92,
          "en": "We can add deleteResource as a key here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 107.92,
          "end": 109.57,
          "en": "and point at this removeResource.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 110.87,
          "end": 112.91,
          "en": "Of course you could always use the same names here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 112.91,
          "end": 114.65,
          "en": "if you wanted that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 114.65,
          "end": 117.081,
          "en": "And now we can inject deleteResource",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 117.081,
          "end": 119.94,
          "en": "into the learning Resource component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 119.94,
          "end": 123.78,
          "en": "Here we can now inject deleteResource",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 124.63,
          "end": 126.26,
          "en": "so this newly added key,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 126.26,
          "end": 129.58,
          "en": "which points at the removeResource method.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 129.58,
          "end": 133.03,
          "en": "And when the user clicks this button here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 133.03,
          "end": 135.641,
          "en": "with a click listener, we point at this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 135.641,
          "end": 139.153,
          "en": "deleteResource method, which was injected.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 140.99,
          "end": 144.7,
          "en": "Actually we don't just point at it we also execute it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 144.7,
          "end": 147.48,
          "en": "And for that we need the idea of the Resource.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 147.48,
          "end": 149.843,
          "en": "So we should expect that as a prop.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 151.5,
          "end": 154.67000000000002,
          "en": "And once we do get the idea of this Resource as a prop,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 154.67000000000002,
          "end": 157.038,
          "en": "we can use it here to provide it to this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 157.038,
          "end": 159.55,
          "en": "deleteResource method, and therefore",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 159.55,
          "end": 163.19299999999998,
          "en": "to the removeResource method in the Resources.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 164.5,
          "end": 168.23,
          "en": "Now we just need to ensure that this ID prop is provided.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 168.23,
          "end": 171.49,
          "en": "So in storedResources where we are creating",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 171.49,
          "end": 174.465,
          "en": "all the learning Resources, there we now also provide",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 174.465,
          "end": 177.293,
          "en": "this ID prop, which we just added.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 179.7,
          "end": 182.89,
          "en": "With that it should work, but you'll notice",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 182.89,
          "end": 186.52,
          "en": "that if I click Delete, nothing happens.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 186.52,
          "end": 189.385,
          "en": "On the other hand if I open the developer tools,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 189.385,
          "end": 193.23,
          "en": "we will see that the Resource was deleted.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 193.23,
          "end": 198.23,
          "en": "We can actually see this best if I don't log the Resources.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 198.23,
          "end": 200.163,
          "en": "But for example, the length here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 201.01,
          "end": 203.62,
          "en": "If the length is one, that means that the Resource",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 203.62,
          "end": 207.125,
          "en": "was deleted because initially we have a length of two.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 207.125,
          "end": 208.44,
          "en": "So let's try this again.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 208.44,
          "end": 210.59,
          "en": "If I reload, click Delete, you'll see,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 210.59,
          "end": 212.135,
          "en": "we get a length of one.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 212.135,
          "end": 214.17000000000002,
          "en": "So the Resource was deleted,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 214.17000000000002,
          "end": 216.37,
          "en": "but we don't see this on the screen.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 216.37,
          "end": 217.203,
          "en": "Why?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 218.61,
          "end": 222.54,
          "en": "Because of provide inject and how it works.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 222.54,
          "end": 227.38,
          "en": "We do provide our storedResources here right.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 227.38,
          "end": 230.21,
          "en": "Now, view executes this provide method",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 230.21,
          "end": 232.94,
          "en": "in the end when it creates this component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 232.94,
          "end": 236.526,
          "en": "So it then injects this storedResources array",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 236.526,
          "end": 240.22,
          "en": "into all the components that need Resources.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 240.22,
          "end": 242.55,
          "en": "The thing is, this is an array,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 242.55,
          "end": 246.1,
          "en": "and therefore it's a value stored in memory.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 246.1,
          "end": 249.41,
          "en": "It's a reference value in JavaScript.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 249.41,
          "end": 253.41,
          "en": "When we change this array by pushing or by unshifting,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 253.41,
          "end": 255.6,
          "en": "as we're doing it for adding a Resource",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 255.6,
          "end": 258.27,
          "en": "that changes the same array in memory,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 258.27,
          "end": 260.26,
          "en": "which we originally provided,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 260.26,
          "end": 262.619,
          "en": "and therefore view as able to recognize",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 262.619,
          "end": 264.65,
          "en": "the changes we made to it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 264.65,
          "end": 268,
          "en": "And all the places that injected this Resources key,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 268,
          "end": 270.593,
          "en": "will get notified about those changes.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 272,
          "end": 274.32,
          "en": "If we however use this approach,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 274.32,
          "end": 279.243,
          "en": "I'm overriding this storedResources with a brand new array.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 279.243,
          "end": 284.04,
          "en": "And this brand new array is then not reprovided",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 284.04,
          "end": 285.76,
          "en": "to all the other components.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 285.76,
          "end": 288.842,
          "en": "So all the components that inject the Resources",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 288.842,
          "end": 293.023,
          "en": "are still working with the old, with the original array.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 294.08,
          "end": 295.90999999999997,
          "en": "So how can we work around that?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 295.90999999999997,
          "end": 299.29,
          "en": "Well, one easy way of working around that here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 299.29,
          "end": 302.732,
          "en": "is that we don't overwrite the old array,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 302.732,
          "end": 306.85,
          "en": "but that instead we use a slightly different approach.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 306.85,
          "end": 310.55,
          "en": "We get the index of the Resource we wanna delete",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 310.55,
          "end": 312.8,
          "en": "in our storedResources array.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 312.8,
          "end": 315.67,
          "en": "And we can do this with the findIndex method,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 315.67,
          "end": 318.54,
          "en": "which exists on JavaScript arrays.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 318.54,
          "end": 321.63,
          "en": "Here I wanna find the Resource where the ID",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 321.63,
          "end": 325.3,
          "en": "is equal to the Resource ID we're getting as a argument.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 325.3,
          "end": 328.22,
          "en": "That's then giving us the index of the Resource",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 328.22,
          "end": 329.273,
          "en": "we wanna delete.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 330.89,
          "end": 333.32,
          "en": "And then we can use the splice method",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 333.32,
          "end": 336.77,
          "en": "on the storedResources array to splice.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 336.77,
          "end": 340.84000000000003,
          "en": "So to remove this element at this index",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 340.84000000000003,
          "end": 342.563,
          "en": "and just this element.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 344.08,
          "end": 346.58,
          "en": "This manipulates the original array",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 346.58,
          "end": 348.81,
          "en": "instead of creating a new one.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 348.81,
          "end": 351.31,
          "en": "So it's just like pushing and unshifting,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 351.31,
          "end": 354.72,
          "en": "and therefore here view will be able to recognize this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 354.72,
          "end": 357.791,
          "en": "and all the components that injected this array",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 357.791,
          "end": 360.282,
          "en": "will notice this as well.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 360.282,
          "end": 363.32,
          "en": "So now if I reload and click Delete,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 363.32,
          "end": 367.03,
          "en": "we are able to delete Resources.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 367.03,
          "end": 370.08,
          "en": "So let's also add a new Resource here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 372.57,
          "end": 375.12,
          "en": "and we can delete that as well.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 375.12,
          "end": 377.286,
          "en": "So that's now all working,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 377.286,
          "end": 381.16,
          "en": "and with that, we got this app finished.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 381.16,
          "end": 384.63,
          "en": "And we used a lot of the concepts you learned about",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 384.63,
          "end": 386.59,
          "en": "throughout the last modules.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 386.59,
          "end": 390.25,
          "en": "And therefore hopefully you now have a better idea",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 390.25,
          "end": 392.29,
          "en": "of how to work with components,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 392.29,
          "end": 396.67,
          "en": "how to build at least a little bit bigger view applications",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 396.67,
          "end": 399.873,
          "en": "and how all these different features are working together.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "errors": []
}
